","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"FdoIc2GfFO35OzVVC4fi2w","review_id":"lZoq7xzPqT28RlbdQrRb3A","date":"2014-01-12T20:01:25","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9327852725982666,"text_excerpt":"I just arrived and checked into my hotel and wanted a place to grab a quick lunch. So right across the street I find P &G. It's a cafeteria style place where you can get some good food for less than $10. I kept it simple with the fried shrimp and french fries. I was happy with my decision. Plenty of food, well cooked fries, and tasty shrimp. This isn't a touristy place, instead it seemed most people in there worked in the area. It was a nice glimpse into the real world of NOLA as opposed to the tourism."},{"business_id":"FdoIc2GfFO35OzVVC4fi2w","review_id":"_m7MZ9n5qEIOKGKmbr_i_A","date":"2012-03-08T19:31:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9226493239402771,"text_excerpt":"P & G is a great value at lunch. A fellow Yelper suggested I try P&G and I am glad that I listened. The restaurant is set up like a diner. You enter, order at the counter, get your food, pay and find a seat. One of the daily specials was red beans so I didn't need to look any further. The portion was very large. In fact, my entire plate was covered with so much that it was difficult to carry back to the table without spilling some. I opted for hot sausage, but they also had plain smoked sausage. The red beans were very good. While not spicy, the beans were well seasoned. All of the staff I encountered were very friendly. Although there was no traditional server, employees were circulating..."},{"business_id":"FdoIc2GfFO35OzVVC4fi2w","review_id":"gHC-sm5ZtUK6gqwp_FSMrQ","date":"2009-09-14T21:13:32","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9206040501594543,"text_excerpt":"I've walked past P&G Restaurant many times on the way from my parking garage to the building where I work. I never considered eating here until one of my coworkers invited me to lunch. We went last Friday... Great poboys for not a lot of $$$ and friendly service. I saw a tap for a keg so I'm assuming they have a liquor license. I highly recommend if you're looking for a good meal at a great price."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"FdoIc2GfFO35OzVVC4fi2w","photo_id":"dB3JLzCiwUlKXxC4wZGOrw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/dB3JLzCiwUlKXxC4wZGOrw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8938440084457397},{"business_id":"FdoIc2GfFO35OzVVC4fi2w","photo_id":"G3sDPxqZ8RPWqXaWNUKRnA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/G3sDPxqZ8RPWqXaWNUKRnA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8023765087127686},{"business_id":"FdoIc2GfFO35OzVVC4fi2w","photo_id":"kaOyy3AMCpWkaMQSuiBEJA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/kaOyy3AMCpWkaMQSuiBEJA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7793649435043335},{"business_id":"FdoIc2GfFO35OzVVC4fi2w","photo_id":"a4PvGDa5RxHxTsf83C0BHg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/a4PvGDa5RxHxTsf83C0BHg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7644262313842773},{"business_id":"FdoIc2GfFO35OzVVC4fi2w","photo_id":"28wX6BzTRed8CvBDk7MirA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/28wX6BzTRed8CvBDk7MirA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7637059092521667}]},"notebook_case":null}
